/* Mud long name.. 
 * Returns a readable version of the muds name.
 * pretty stupid and simple way to do it, shoulud at least check a .h file.
 * Baldrick, dec '96.
 */

string mud_long_name()
  {
  /* FluffOS PORT NOTE: original was `switch (mud_name()) { default: ... }`
   * with no real case labels -- this driver rejects a switch containing
   * only a `default:` (see AGENTS.md compile-time bug classes). The switch
   * was doing nothing but returning a constant regardless of mud_name(),
   * so collapsed to the equivalent plain return. */
  return "Obviously not decided yet";
}
